<title>USA: Occidental unit president retires.</title>
<headline>Occidental unit president retires.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Occidental Petroleum Corp said on Thursday that the president and chief executive officer of its Occidental Oil and Gas Corp unit retired.</p>
<p>David Martin, 65, also retired from the board of directors of Occidental Petroleum.</p>
<p>Martin, who joined the company in 1962, held various management positions and was named president of its international oil and gas unit in 1983.</p>
